📈 DataForge – Stock Market Analytics Dashboard

DataForge is an interactive stock market analytics dashboard built using Streamlit, Python, and Yahoo Finance (yfinance).
It allows users to analyze real-time stock prices, visualize trends, and perform portfolio-level analysis with dynamic charts.

🚀 Deployed on Streamlit Cloud 
🔗 Live App: https://dataforge-jr.streamlit.app

🛠️ Tech Stack: 

| Category        | Tools                      |  
| --------------- | -------------------------- | 
| Frontend        | Streamlit                  | 
| Backend         | Python                     | 
| Data Source     | Yahoo Finance (`yfinance`) |
| Data Processing | Pandas, NumPy              |
| Visualization   | Plotly, Cufflinks          |
| Deployment      | Streamlit Cloud            |
| Version Control | GitHub                     |


📂 Project Structure
DataForge/
│
├── app.py                # Main Streamlit application
├── requirements.txt      # Python dependencies
└── README.md             # Project documentation


